     <P> </P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=a align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT size=3>    </FONT><FONT size=4>足球是一项集体的运动，考验的不仅仅是球员个人的运动素质，还要求极高的团队精神及协作能力。不管你是“职业级”还是“菜鸟级”，你都可以在足球运动中享受快乐，磨练意志。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=a align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT size=4>    在校团委与体育组的全力支持与精心指导下，团学联体健部与足球社联合组织策划了本学期“绍兴一中高二足球超级联赛”。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: -7.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 7.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1" class=a align=left><FONT size=4><STRONG><SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"><FONT face=Calibri>一、</FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">比赛时间</SPAN></STRONG></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0" class=a align=left><FONT size=4><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2016</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">年</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>11</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>-12</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">月（期中考以后）。每周三活动课，不占用同学们的其他时间。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: -21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 42.55pt" class=a><FONT size=4><STRONG><SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"><FONT face=Calibri>二、</FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">参赛对象</SPAN></STRONG></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0" class=a><FONT size=4><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">高二同学，以楼层为单位参赛。（共</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>4</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">支队伍）</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: -21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1" class=a><FONT size=4><STRONG><SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"><FONT face=Calibri>三、</FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">报名方式</SPAN></STRONG></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0" class=a><FONT size=4><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>1. </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">每楼层报名人数至少</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>8</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">人，不超过</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>12</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">人。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0" class=a><FONT size=4><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2. </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">报名者须交</SPAN><FONT face=Calibri> <B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN></B></FONT><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">元</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>/</FONT></SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">人</SPAN></B><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">参赛费（用于购买奖品及裁判用具）</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0" class=a><FONT size=4><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>3. </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">选择一名球员为队长。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0" class=a><FONT size=4><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>4. </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">在各楼层的报名球员中，选择三名作为裁判组（固定）。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0" class=a><FONT size=4><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>5. </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">报名截止时间：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri> 2016</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">年</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>11</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>16</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">日（周三）</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0" class=a><FONT size=4><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>6. </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">各楼层报名点：</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0" class=a><FONT size=4><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">       </SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">楼：唐左宜</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri> 201</FONT></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0" class=a><FONT size=4><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">               </SPAN>3</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">楼：朱弘韬</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri> 206</FONT></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0" class=a><FONT size=4><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">               </SPAN>4</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">楼：孙隽龑</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri> 210</FONT></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=4><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">               </SPAN>5</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">楼：郦藤恺</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri> 214</FONT></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: -21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1" class=a><FONT size=4><STRONG><SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"><FONT face=Calibri>四、</FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">比赛制度</SPAN></STRONG></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0" class=a><FONT size=4><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>1.</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">每周三进行一场比赛，采取循环赛。总共</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>6</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">场。赛程安排将由各楼层队长抽签决定。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0" class=a><FONT size=4><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2.</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">分上下半场，</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>20</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">分钟</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>/</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">半场，中场休息</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>5</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">分钟。根据比赛情况，主裁有权进行适当补时。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0" class=a><FONT size=4><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>3.</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">比赛日当天中午，参赛楼层队长须向裁判组上报首发名单。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0" class=a><FONT size=4><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>4.</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">首发</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>8</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">名球员，替补</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>4</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">名。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: -21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1" class=a><FONT size=4><STRONG><SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"><FONT face=Calibri>五、</FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">转会</SPAN></STRONG></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0" class=a><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT size=4>在球员本人同意及双方队长协调成功的情况下，同意转会。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0" class=a><FONT size=4><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">注意：队长不可转会。每楼层人数不得超过</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>3</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">人（转入转出总和）。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: -21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1" class=a><FONT size=4><STRONG><SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"><FONT face=Calibri>六、</FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">奖项</SPAN></STRONG></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0" class=a><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT size=4>赛季结束后，积分榜前两名的楼层将获得奖品，具体待定，冠军还将获得奖杯一只！</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: -21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1" class=a><FONT size=4><STRONG><SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"><FONT face=Calibri>七、</FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">球服</SPAN></STRONG></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0" class=a><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT size=4>上场队员服装须统一。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: -21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1" class=a><FONT size=4><STRONG><SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"><FONT face=Calibri>八、</FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">裁判</SPAN></STRONG></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0" class=a><FONT size=4><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">由每楼层上报，赛事组委会认可后，由体育组老师负责培训，培训时间：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>11</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>14</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">日中午。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: -21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1" class=a><FONT size=4><STRONG><SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"><FONT face=Calibri>九、</FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">注意事项</SPAN></STRONG></FONT></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0" class=a><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT size=4>   纪律方面：</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0" class=a><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT size=4>       ①参赛球员必须严格遵守足球竞赛规则，服从赛事组委会安排。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0" class=a><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT size=4>       ②比赛期间“友谊第一，比赛第二。”不漫骂，恶意冲撞对方球员。如有此类行为，赛事组委会有权上报德育处并纳入学生品德考核。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: -63pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 84pt; mso-char-indent-count: -6.0; mso-para-margin-left: 2.0gd" class=a><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT size=4>安全方面：</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: -63pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 84pt; mso-char-indent-count: -6.0; mso-para-margin-left: 2.0gd" class=a><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT size=4>    ①当值裁判组应在塞前对天气及场地状况进行考察，如不适宜比赛，有权取消比赛。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: -63pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 84pt; mso-char-indent-count: -6.0; mso-para-margin-left: 2.0gd" class=a><FONT size=4><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">    </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">②比赛中如遇较为严重的突发状况，应终止比赛。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0" class=a><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT size=4>    另外，希望同学们处理好比赛与学习的关系，做到劳逸结合，学习运动两不误。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: -21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1" class=a><FONT size=4><STRONG><SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"><FONT face=Calibri>十、</FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">其他</SPAN></STRONG></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0" class=a><FONT size=4><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">参赛球员比赛时必须按时到场，因故无法到场的，需说明原因，并在当值主裁同意的情况下，更换球员。如超时</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>5</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">分钟还未到场的，该楼层积分扣</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>1</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">分。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0" class=a><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT size=4 face=Calibri>    </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=a><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT size=4>   特别鸣谢体育组老师们的悉心指导与培训！</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=a><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT size=4>   比赛细节或因实际情况稍作调整，体健部及足球社对赛事有最终解释权。</FONT></SPAN></P>
